' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006 Web UI — selected team surface
actor Operator
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Mocked proxy\n(test only)" as Proxy
database "State Registry" as Registry
Operator -> UI: open application
UI -> Proxy: GET /ui/v1/teams
Proxy --> UI: supplied team_id/name list
UI -> UI: select exactly one team
UI -> Proxy: GET /ui/v1/teams/{selected}/dashboard
Proxy -> Registry: forward selected-team read
Registry --> Proxy: canonical response
Proxy --> UI: unchanged response
Operator -> UI: select another team
UI -> UI: invalidate old requests/state
UI -> Proxy: close old stream; open /teams/{new}/stream
@enduml
